<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-4 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">Key engineering decisions</h2>
  <div class="space-y-4">
    <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
      <span class="mt-0.5 font-mono text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#5a9100]">01</span>
      <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]"><strong class="font-semibold text-[#111827]">Design for HIPAA from the first line of code:</strong> Retrofitting compliance into a healthcare product is harder than building it in from the start.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
      <span class="mt-0.5 font-mono text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#5a9100]">02</span>
      <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]"><strong class="font-semibold text-[#111827]">Beta with real practices before general availability:</strong> Patient communication is high-stakes enough that we're validating it with select practices first.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
      <span class="mt-0.5 font-mono text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#5a9100]">03</span>
      <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]"><strong class="font-semibold text-[#111827]">Fit into the practice management software already in use:</strong> A tool that requires switching systems of record is a much harder sell than one that plugs into what's already there.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

